MIB files of this snmp3 installation.

A record link can name its object as MODULE::name.index. The module looks for the MIB module in the places an IOC
names with snmp3Mib, then in this directory, then in the directories of the system, and takes the first place that
holds it. snmp3Show prints the place and the file of every MIB module it read.

The module ships no MIB file. A file placed here is found by every IOC that uses this installation. Keep the
notice of a MIB file with it and do not change its text.
